WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.305
The balloon animals started smashing windows and chasing people.

2
00:00:07.306 --> 00:00:11.518
The clowns laughed and ran off.

3
00:00:11.519 --> 00:00:15.877
Crash! A balloon lion knocked over a hot dog stand.

4
00:00:15.878 --> 00:00:18.850
"My hot dogs!" the owner cried.

5
00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:22.900
"Rocket Girl, help!" a woman cried.

6
00:00:22.901 --> 00:00:26.761
A balloon tiger snapped its jaws at her.

7
00:00:26.762 --> 00:00:29.468
Roxy shot toward the balloon tiger.

8
00:00:29.469 --> 00:00:33.251
The tiger spun around and faced her.

9
00:00:33.252 --> 00:00:37.322
Roxy grabbed it and held it on the ground.

10
00:00:37.323 --> 00:00:41.495
The tiger wriggled free and then rolled on top of her. "Grr!"

11
00:00:41.496 --> 00:00:45.092
Roxy struggled with the big balloon. She

12
00:00:45.093 --> 00:00:48.743
squeezed as hard as she could. Pop!

13
00:00:48.744 --> 00:00:52.824
The balloon tiger zipped back and forth as the air left it. Soon

14
00:00:52.825 --> 00:00:56.379
the lifeless balloon fell to the street. Roxy

15
00:00:56.380 --> 00:01:00.091
quickly popped all the other balloon animals. Then

16
00:01:00.092 --> 00:01:02.901
she went after the clowns. ***

17
00:01:02.902 --> 00:01:06.369
Terrell, Jack, and Mara were in science.

18
00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:13.338
Terrell pointed out the window. "I see clowns!"

19
00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:18.668
Mara scratched her head. "Why are they jogging?"

20
00:01:18.669 --> 00:01:21.184
*** Mr. Bubbles stopped

21
00:01:21.185 --> 00:01:23.861
jogging. "Take a break, boys," he

22
00:01:23.862 --> 00:01:28.289
said. "I need . . . to catch . . . my

23
00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:31.364
breath." The other clowns fell

24
00:01:31.365 --> 00:01:34.817
over. "I can't run anymore, boss," one

25
00:01:34.818 --> 00:01:37.657
said. "My legs are

26
00:01:37.658 --> 00:01:41.757
tired!" "It's too bad we left the car," another

27
00:01:41.758 --> 00:01:46.398
said. Mr. Bubbles nodded. "This escape isn't going

28
00:01:46.399 --> 00:01:50.765
well." "There you are!" Roxy swooped down toward the clowns.

29
00:01:50.766 --> 00:01:54.945
"Quick, boys!" Mr. Bubbles cried. "Run!"

30
00:01:54.946 --> 00:01:57.118
The other clowns tried to move.

31
00:01:57.119 --> 00:02:00.484
But police officers arrived and surrounded them.

32
00:02:00.485 --> 00:02:02.994
Roxy didn't see Detective Smith.

33
00:02:02.995 --> 00:02:05.900
"I guess he's still afraid of clowns."

34
00:02:05.901 --> 00:02:07.917
She grabbed Mr. Bubbles' arm.

35
00:02:07.918 --> 00:02:10.912
"You're going back to prison!" she said.

36
00:02:10.913 --> 00:02:17.280
Mr. Bubbles pulled a rubber chicken from his pocket. "Grow!"

37
00:02:17.281 --> 00:02:21.582
The rubber chicken grew fast.

38
00:02:21.583 --> 00:02:26.672
Cluck, cluck! The giant rubber chicken pecked at Roxy.

39
00:02:26.673 --> 00:02:32.009
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams blasted it into little pieces.

40
00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:33.781
Terrell looked around.

41
00:02:33.782 --> 00:02:39.806
"Roxy is never around when Rocket Girl shows up," he thought.

42
00:02:39.807 --> 00:02:43.458
Mr. Bubbles squeezed the flower on his jacket.

43
00:02:43.459 --> 00:02:45.922
Smoke poured out.

44
00:02:45.923 --> 00:02:48.601
Roxy felt the clown slip from her hand.

45
00:02:48.602 --> 00:02:52.292
"Where did he go?" Roxy couldn't see anything.

46
00:02:52.293 --> 00:02:53.871
She heard a click.

47
00:02:53.872 --> 00:02:58.907
Roxy used her super breath to blow away the smoke.

48
00:02:58.908 --> 00:03:01.681
Detective Smith stood next to Mr. Bubbles. The

49
00:03:01.682 --> 00:03:03.727
clown was in handcuffs. "You

50
00:03:03.728 --> 00:03:06.165
came!" Roxy said. Detective

51
00:03:06.166 --> 00:03:08.247
Smith nodded. "I

52
00:03:08.248 --> 00:03:11.408
decided to face my fear, just like you said. Thanks,

53
00:03:11.409 --> 00:03:15.990
Rocket Girl." ***

54
00:03:15.991 --> 00:03:20.070
Roxy walked into school.

55
00:03:20.071 --> 00:03:23.564
"You missed the clowns, Roxy!" Jack said.

56
00:03:23.565 --> 00:03:27.175
"And a giant rubber chicken!" Mara said.

57
00:03:27.176 --> 00:03:30.673
"Really?" Roxy pretended to be surprised.

58
00:03:30.674 --> 00:03:33.065
Terrell gave Roxy a suspicious look.

59
00:03:33.066 --> 00:03:37.407
"You also missed Rocket Girl—again."

60
00:03:37.408 --> 00:03:40.244
Roxy just shrugged.

